    narr:narration """This narrative holds two positions that frame the product by contrast and by priority. The founding move is [defining the product against real-time chat tools as the named anti-pattern](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat), stated early in the arc. Two weeks later the focus shifted toward [context preservation — linking decisions back to the threads that produced them](narr:Position_ContextPreservationNextSprint), which the team reports as the top request from beta users. The trajectory runs from negative definition toward a concrete build priority; nothing here records a resolution beyond the sprint commitment.""" ;
